GRADER_SUBJECT=a manufacturing assistant (cableAI chat) with live, read-only access to the plant's MES through 22 tools: the user's sites; machines (state, job queue, state history, comments, attached document names); jobs and job counts; production and inventory lots including why a lot is unavailable; production orders; shift windows; storage locations; quality orders (parameters, limits, recorded values); rework tasks; and a knowledge search over uploaded and SharePoint documents, the site team's saved knowledge and help topics. It also has DesignCenter (cableCORE) tools for cable designs. It has no direct feed of machine setpoints, sensors or prediction models; recipes, procedures or limits are only available if the knowledge search or a quality order actually returns them. Any claim about plant facts that no successful tool call can support is a fail. Saying clearly that the data or capability does not exist, and offering what it can show, is 'not supported', not a fail.
